[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 300.31, "timestamp": "00:05:00", "text": "そこにこのウォッチストリークがある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 302.629, "timestamp": "00:05:02", "text": "えっと、それはポイントシステムみたいなもので"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 305.749, "timestamp": "00:05:05", "text": "Twitchではチャンネルポイントのようなものがあります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 308.55, "timestamp": "00:05:08", "text": "えーと、ポイントは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 312.71, "timestamp": "00:05:12", "text": "どれくらい見てるか、そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 315.67, "timestamp": "00:05:15", "text": "ポイントボックスなどを集める"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 318.629, "timestamp": "00:05:18", "text": "15分おきくらいに。忘れた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 321.59, "timestamp": "00:05:21", "text": "仕組みはこうだ。アイテムを引き換えることができ、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 321.723, "timestamp": "00:05:21", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/aACLJToYP6FMtiMkCyV12FJchjJLrwy1qzEVqHiZEyFaZdsbRkj-yqg_i_m8eqjYX-fTLgPLCzk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hm 🤔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 323.35, "timestamp": "00:05:23", "text": "すべて。右。それで、これがあるんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 325.51, "timestamp": "00:05:25", "text": "連続視聴記録機能。えーと、その量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 328.23, "timestamp": "00:05:28", "text": "ストリーマーを視聴するたびに、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 330.95, "timestamp": "00:05:30", "text": "そのような一定のポイント数。のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 333.909, "timestamp": "00:05:33", "text": "それ。それはTwitchのやつだよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 336.71, "timestamp": "00:05:36", "text": "そして、キックにも。がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 339.83, "timestamp": "00:05:39", "text": "キックでも同じことが起こる。時計はありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 341.909, "timestamp": "00:05:41", "text": "トリックだが、チャンネルポイントがある。それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 344.39, "timestamp": "00:05:44", "text": "Twitchにあるもの全てをミラーリングしました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 347.749, "timestamp": "00:05:47", "text": "チャンネルポイントもキック対象です。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 350.76, "timestamp": "00:05:50", "author": "@DinyoF